{"name":"HTML","description":"Describe the structure and meaning of a web page · HTML organizes a page into headings, paragraphs, links, forms, images, and other meaningful elements. CSS controls appearance and JavaScript adds behavior. Choosing the right element improves accessibility, keyboard behavior, search, and maintenance.","quote":"The code AI wrote has a bunch of angle brackets and English words. What are those for?","agentPrompt":"Review this article's HTML structure: use the correct heading element for the page title, a real link for View source, and buttons for actions. Preserve the visual styling and verify every link and button with a keyboard.","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-html\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>HTML</h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">You might say</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">The code AI wrote has a bunch of angle brackets and English words. What are those for?</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">Describe the structure and meaning of a web page</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>HTML organizes a page into headings, paragraphs, links, forms, images, and other meaningful elements. CSS controls appearance and JavaScript adds behavior. Choosing the right element improves accessibility, keyboard behavior, search, and maintenance.</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo responsive-detail-demo diagram-detail-demo\" style=\"--detail-demo-width:400px\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"html-demo\">\n    <div class=\"html-tree\">\n      <span class=\"html-node\">&lt;html&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"html-node html-d1\">&lt;head&gt; <em>Meta information</em></span>\n      <span class=\"html-node html-d1\">&lt;body&gt;</span>\n      <span class=\"html-node html-d2\">&lt;h1&gt; <em>Title</em></span>\n      <span class=\"html-node html-d2\">&lt;p&gt; <em>Paragraph</em></span>\n      <span class=\"html-node html-d2\">&lt;a&gt; <em>Link</em></span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"html-arrow\">→</span>\n    <div class=\"html-page\">\n      <b style=\"font-size:14px;color:var(--text)\">Xiaoli&#x27;s homepage</b>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">I like hiking and taking pictures. </span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--brand);text-decoration:underline\">View my photo album →</span>\n    </div>\n  </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">You can say this to an AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>Review this article&#x27;s HTML structure: use the correct heading element for the page title, a real link for View source, and buttons for actions. Preserve the visual styling and verify every link and button with a keyboard.</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>When to use it</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Build page structure</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"align-self:flex-start;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text)\">A project report for people to read</span><span style=\"align-self:flex-start;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);text-align:left\">Clear headings, highlights, images, and sections<br>Help readers quickly scan for what matters to them.</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">HTML turns content into a reading experience.</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Mark headings and sections</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"display:block;width:100%;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:5px 8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);text-align:left\">🔒 report.example.com/launch</span><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%;justify-content:space-between\"><b style=\"font-size:13px\">New product launch report</b><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">Open page</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Send a URL and anyone can view it in a browser.</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Create forms and links with native behavior</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">▶ Video</span><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">↗ Link</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">Fill out form</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">A page can provide interactive elements such as media, links, and forms.</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Give content machine-readable meaning</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\"># Launch plan<br>- Launch this week</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">→</span><span style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:7px 10px\"><b style=\"display:block;font-size:13px\">Launch plan</b><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">· Launch this week</span></span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>When NOT to use it</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Use generic div elements for every role</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">&lt;div&gt; card<br><span style=\"margin-left:12px;color:var(--red)\">The content that follows may still be inside this element…</span></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">A missing &lt;/div&gt; makes the DOM structure differ from what you expect.</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Choose tags only for their default appearance</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;text&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">The tags overlap improperly; the browser may rearrange them during error recovery.</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Skip heading levels to get a larger font</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:5px;padding:3px 7px;font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">&lt;head&gt; Welcome to my website</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">The structure is invalid; the browser may move the content into body during error recovery.</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">Put unsafe user content directly into HTML</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span style=\"width:22px;height:26px;border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:3px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">W</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">index.html → Save as .docx</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">DOCX is not HTML; browsers do not parse it as page structure.</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><div class=\"html-anat\"><span class=\"html-punc\">&lt;</span><span class=\"ap html-tagname\" data-ap=\"open\">a</span><span class=\"ap html-attr\" data-ap=\"attr\"> href=&quot;https://vibe.guide&quot;</span><span class=\"html-punc\">&gt;</span><span class=\"ap html-content\" data-ap=\"content\">Click to see</span><span class=\"html-punc\">&lt;/</span><span class=\"ap html-tagname\" data-ap=\"close\">a</span><span class=\"html-punc\">&gt;</span></div></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"open\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">Opening Tag</span></button><span class=\"pd\">Add angle brackets to the tag name to tell the browser &quot;Start here&quot;</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"attr\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">Attribute</span></button><span class=\"pd\">Additional information written in the start tag, such as link address and image path</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"content\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">Content</span></button><span class=\"pd\">The part between the two pairs of angle brackets, only change this part when modifying the copy.</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"close\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">4</span><span class=\"pn\">Closing Tag</span></button><span class=\"pd\">An extra slash tells the browser &quot;end here&quot;</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">div</div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;div&gt; … &lt;/div&gt;</span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">Use it to organize content and layout when there are no more appropriate semantic tags</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">Headings &amp; p</div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;</span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">Titles and paragraphs, the skeleton of the article</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">Link &amp; Image</div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;a&gt; &lt;img&gt;</span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">a jumps to the URL, img posts the picture</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">Button &amp; Input</div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;button&gt; &lt;input&gt;</span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">Interactive parts that can be clicked and filled on the page</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">Typical use cases</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">Page document</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;max-width:400px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"align-self:flex-end;max-width:70%;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);border-radius:12px 12px 4px 12px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px\">Help me make a personal homepage</div>\n      <div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:6px\">Okay, here is your index.html:</div>\n        <div class=\"terminal-win\"><div class=\"terminal-body\">\n          <span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#c792ea\">h1</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&gt;</span>Xiaoli&#x27;s homepage<span class=\"terminal-d\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:#c792ea\">h1</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&gt;</span></span>\n          <span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#c792ea\">p</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&gt;</span>I like climbing mountains and taking pictures. <span class=\"terminal-d\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:#c792ea\">p</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&gt;</span></span>\n          <span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#c792ea\">a</span> <span class=\"terminal-a\">href</span>=<span class=\"terminal-g\">&quot;/photos&quot;</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&gt;</span>View my photo album<span class=\"terminal-d\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:#c792ea\">a</span><span class=\"terminal-d\">&gt;</span></span>\n        </div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">Article</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace\">view-source:https://my-first-page.vercel.app</div>\n      <div style=\"padding:10px 12px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.8\">\n        <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">1</span> <span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;h1&gt;</span>Xiaoli’s homepage<span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;/h1&gt;</span><br>\n        <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">2</span> <span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;p&gt;</span>I like hiking and taking pictures. <span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;/p&gt;</span><br>\n        <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">3</span> <span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;a</span> <span style=\"color:var(--warning)\">href=&quot;/photos&quot;</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&gt;</span>View my photo album<span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;/a&gt;</span>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">Form</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg)\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;padding:12px 14px;border-right:1px solid var(--border-light)\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px\">Xiaoli&#x27;s homepage</b>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-top:4px;outline:2px solid var(--brand);border-radius:3px;padding:1px 3px\">I like hiking and taking pictures. </div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--brand);text-decoration:underline;margin-top:4px\">View my photo album →</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:1;padding:10px 12px;font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.8;background:var(--bg-soft)\">\n        <span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;h1&gt;</span>…<span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;/h1&gt;</span><br>\n        <span style=\"background:var(--brand-light);border-radius:3px;padding:0 3px\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;p&gt;</span>…<span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;/p&gt;</span></span><br>\n        <span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;a&gt;</span>…<span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;/a&gt;</span>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">Navigation</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:400px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"padding:8px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light);font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">Common tag recognition</div>\n      <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;background:var(--border-light)\">\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;div&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">Universal container</span></div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;p&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">Paragraph</span></div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;a&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">Link</span></div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;img&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">Picture</span></div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;button&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">Button</span></div>\n        <div style=\"background:var(--bg);padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px\"><b style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;color:var(--code-keyword)\">&lt;input&gt;</b> <span style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">Input box</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"selector-recommendation\" aria-label=\"Recommended tool\"><div class=\"section-title\">Recommended tool</div><a class=\"selector-recommendation-card\" href=\"https://selector-pro.org/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"Open the Selector Pro website to pick a page element and copy a fine-tuning request to AI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div class=\"selector-recommendation-copy\"><span class=\"selector-recommendation-label\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>Web fine-tuning tool · Selector Pro</span><h2>Select page elements for precise AI edits</h2><p>Click a button, text, or card, note the change, then copy its exact location to AI.</p><span class=\"selector-recommendation-action\">Open Selector Pro website<i aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</i></span></div><div class=\"selector-recommendation-demo\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"selector-mini-browser-bar\"><i></i><span>your-site.com</span></div><div class=\"selector-mini-page\"><span class=\"selector-mini-logo\"></span><span class=\"selector-mini-nav\"></span><span class=\"selector-mini-title\"></span><span class=\"selector-mini-line\"></span><span class=\"selector-mini-button\"></span><span class=\"selector-mini-card\"></span><span class=\"selector-mini-target\"><b>Button · Get started</b><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"selector-mini-note\">Use a smaller radius</span><svg class=\"selector-mini-cursor\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 22\"><path d=\"M2 1.5v15.2l4.15-3.72 2.4 6.02 2.65-1.1-2.42-5.82h5.82L2 1.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"selector-mini-output\"><span>Button · Get started</span><b>Copied for AI</b></div></div></a></section><section class=\"references-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Further reading</div><div class=\"reference-list\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Core/Structuring_content\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">Structuring content with HTML</span><span class=\"reference-source\">MDN ↗</span></a><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">HTML: HyperText Markup Language</span><span class=\"reference-source\">MDN ↗</span></a></div></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/en/html","markdown":"# HTML\n\nYou might say\nThe code AI wrote has a bunch of angle brackets and English words. What are those for?\n\n**Describe the structure and meaning of a web page**·HTML organizes a page into headings, paragraphs, links, forms, images, and other meaningful elements. CSS controls appearance and JavaScript adds behavior. Choosing the right element improves accessibility, keyboard behavior, search, and maintenance.\n\n## You can say this to an AI Agent\n\n> “\n> Review this article's HTML structure: use the correct heading element for the page title, a real link for View source, and buttons for actions. Preserve the visual styling and verify every link and button with a keyboard.\n\n### When to use it\n\n- Build page structure\n\nA project report for people to readClear headings, highlights, images, and sections\nHelp readers quickly scan for what matters to them.HTML turns content into a reading experience.\n- Mark headings and sections\n\n🔒 report.example.com/launch\n**New product launch report**Open page\nSend a URL and anyone can view it in a browser.\n- Create forms and links with native behavior\n\n▶ Video↗ LinkFill out form\nA page can provide interactive elements such as media, links, and forms.\n- Give content machine-readable meaning\n\n# Launch plan\n- Launch this week→**Launch plan**· Launch this week\n\n### When NOT to use it\n\n- Use generic div elements for every role\n\n<div> card\nThe content that follows may still be inside this element…A missing </div> makes the DOM structure differ from what you expect.\n- Choose tags only for their default appearance\n\n<b><i>text</b></i>The tags overlap improperly; the browser may rearrange them during error recovery.\n- Skip heading levels to get a larger font\n\n<head> Welcome to my websiteThe structure is invalid; the browser may move the content into body during error recovery.\n- Put unsafe user content directly into HTML\n\nWindex.html → Save as .docx\nDOCX is not HTML; browsers do not parse it as page structure.\n\nAnatomy\n\n<a href=\"https://vibe.guide\">Click to see</a>\n\n1Opening TagAdd angle brackets to the tag name to tell the browser \"Start here\"\n\n2AttributeAdditional information written in the start tag, such as link address and image path\n\n3ContentThe part between the two pairs of angle brackets, only change this part when modifying the copy.\n\n4Closing TagAn extra slash tells the browser \"end here\"\n\nVariants\n\ndiv\n\n<div> … </div>\n\nUse it to organize content and layout when there are no more appropriate semantic tags\n\nHeadings & p\n\n<h1> <p>\n\nTitles and paragraphs, the skeleton of the article\n\nLink & Image\n\n<a> <img>\n\na jumps to the URL, img posts the picture\n\nButton & Input\n\n<button> <input>\n\nInteractive parts that can be clicked and filled on the page\n\nTypical use cases\n\nPage document\n\nHelp me make a personal homepage\n\n      \nOkay, here is your index.html:\n\n        \n<h1>Xiaoli's homepage</h1>\n          <p>I like climbing mountains and taking pictures. </p>\n          <a href=\"/photos\">View my photo album</a>\n\nArticle\n\nview-source:https://my-first-page.vercel.app\n\n      \n1 <h1>Xiaoli’s homepage</h1>\n\n        2 <p>I like hiking and taking pictures. </p>\n\n        3 <a href=\"/photos\">View my photo album</a>\n\nForm\n\n**Xiaoli's homepage**\n        \nI like hiking and taking pictures.\n\n        \nView my photo album →\n\n      \n<h1>…</h1>\n\n        <p>…</p>\n\n        <a>…</a>\n\nNavigation\n\nCommon tag recognition\n\n      \n**<div>** Universal container\n\n        \n**<p>** Paragraph\n\n        \n**<a>** Link\n\n        \n**<img>** Picture\n\n        \n**<button>** Button\n\n        \n**<input>** Input box\n\nRecommended tool\n[Web fine-tuning tool · Selector Pro\n\n## Select page elements for precise AI edits\n\nClick a button, text, or card, note the change, then copy its exact location to AI.\nOpen Selector Pro website↗\n\nyour-site.com\n\n**Button · Get started**Use a smaller radius\n\nButton · Get started**Copied for AI**](https://selector-pro.org/)\n\nFurther reading\n\n[Structuring content with HTMLMDN ↗](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Core/Structuring_content)[HTML: HyperText Markup LanguageMDN ↗](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML)"}